rooms_desc ({"A large welcome mat is the only visable object in the room.","Many pillows lie about feel free to meditate in safety.If there is no safety then i will make it safe.....Personally!","This small room is cluttered with dirty dishes and is not neat as a whole,it is obvious that a very active fighting male lives here.Feel free to have a snack, but if you do please replace it at a later date.","There is a king size canopy bed in the center of the room.  It looks well usedby the covers not being made.  A large oak desk lies in the north wallwhich seems to be very cluttered.  A dresser is located next to the doorwayto the south.  This room seems extremely personal to Elrick so dont getcaught in here without his permission, exceptions are made for people of thefemale gender.","This secret room is the secret teleport room only accessable to Elrickand teleports you to the shop in the town.","This splented chamber is an example of pure luxury.  Expensive tapestriesare hanging from every wall, with painting of various quest solved by themighty Elrick.  Judging by the paintings on the wall you know you shouldn't be herebecause you know you will suffer the cosiquinces!!","A doorway west leads into the weapons chamber while a doorway eastleads into the Armoury storage.  Racks and wall pegs are all along the walls.","Racks of all type of weapons line the walls feel free to equip yourself.........Complimence of Elrick........","All types of armour are hung on pegs on all walls.  Feel free to choose onefor youself.........Complimence of Elrick........","The floor is covered with a thick blue shag rug.  There is an overstuffedchair in the northwest corner and full bookshelves line the wallsThe Bay window on the north wall overlooks a small waterfall and has a very comfortable window seat.It's just big enough for two",})
